WEBVTT

00:29:58.038 --> 00:30:04.746
the idea is, is this an area where there
is gold? And I'm going to look for it.

00:30:05.163 --> 00:30:06.746
I mean, that's that's an idea.

00:30:07.746 --> 00:30:11.996
And formulating a new question
to an idea in my book,

00:30:12.121 --> 00:30:16.829
I'm going to use that this is an area
where I think there might be gold and

00:30:16.829 --> 00:30:19.663
I want to look for it.
Such a nice reframe.

00:30:20.496 --> 00:30:23.788
So, Danny, you mentioned in
your new book, Noize,

00:30:24.579 --> 00:30:28.663
one of my favorite ideas when I read Noise
was the idea of the inner crowd.

00:30:28.663 --> 00:30:30.246
And I wondered if you could explain that